     "text": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "full changelog for 0.75.5:\n\nnew\n- vault in settings saves your logins, cards and contact info, and your bot fills them in to sign in or check out\n- bots can forward email from their own inbox with the original formatting, images and attachments\n- bots record who asked for each slack message they post\n\nimproved\n- auto-review asks less often for things you asked for in your own words\n- after you deny an approval card, your bot stops trying that action\n- emails and slack messages you ask for go out once auto-review allows them\n- sign-in handoffs also offer the site's connector card\n- x connects through your linked account, and x money connects with it\n- routines can run up to 300 times an hour\n- route through this computer shows how many private or vpn sites were blocked\n\nfixed\n- fewer auto-review fallbacks to an approval card\n- auto-review respects \"only draft\" requests\n- asking about your x followers gets a plain answer\n- bot management survives an account merge\n\nalso in 0.75.3\n- halloween pumpkin avatar\n- full chats in team bot dms\n- plugins with multiple servers show each one on its own row\n- replies to slack threads that were also sent to the channel\n\n"
      },
      {
       "t": "link",
       "v": "x.ai/changelog/bot",
       "href": "http://x.ai/changelog/bot"
      }
     ],
